{"id":"52fbf9496f872506","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-lambda-triangle.md","title":"同时归约的三角性质","display":"thm-lambda-triangle — 同时归约的三角性质","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-lambda-triangle","aliases":["56-thm-lambda-triangle"],"display":"thm-lambda-triangle — 同时归约的三角性质","depends_on":["[[56-df-lambda-complete-development]]","[[56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Proposition 10.2.4 and proof, printed p556","source_ocr_block":"577","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-read; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-lambda-triangle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-lambda-triangle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lambda-triangle — 同时归约的三角性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e75dc86b680683eb\" href=\"?note=e75dc86b680683eb\" title=\"56-df-lambda-complete-development\">56-df-lambda-complete-development</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"72b587eaf1edf078\" href=\"?note=72b587eaf1edf078\" title=\"56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution\">56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Proposition 10.2.4 and proof, printed p556"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"577"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-read; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)\">\\(\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\Lambda\">\\(M,N\\in\\Lambda\\)</span>。同时归约 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_\\lambda\">\\(\\Rightarrow_\\lambda\\)</span> 与完全展开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-)^\\star\">\\((-)^\\star\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e75dc86b680683eb\" href=\"?note=e75dc86b680683eb\" title=\"56-df-lambda-complete-development\">56-df-lambda-complete-development</a>；根收缩所需的同时替换接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"72b587eaf1edf078\" href=\"?note=72b587eaf1edf078\" title=\"56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution\">56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M\\Rightarrow_\\lambda N\\Longrightarrow N\\Rightarrow_\\lambda M^\\star.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M\\Rightarrow_\\lambda N\\Longrightarrow N\\Rightarrow_\\lambda M^\\star.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Proposition 10.2.4 及证明（印刷 p556，OCR 页块577），本次已读。按同时归约的推导归纳；根 β 分支使用内部 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"72b587eaf1edf078\" href=\"?note=72b587eaf1edf078\" title=\"56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution\">56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution</a>，其陈述补齐本文件原先仅以原书编号10.2.2引用的接口，应用分支区分左项原本是否为抽象。该陈述立即让同源两条同时归约在 M* 汇合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-lambda-complete-development","status":"resolved","id":"e75dc86b680683eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-complete-development]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"72b587eaf1edf078","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-complete-development","status":"resolved","id":"e75dc86b680683eb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$M,N\\in\\Lambda$。同时归约 $\\Rightarrow_\\lambda$ 与完全展开 $(-)^\\star$ 见 [[56-df-lambda-complete-development]]；根收缩所需的同时替换接口见 [[56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"72b587eaf1edf078","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$M,N\\in\\Lambda$。同时归约 $\\Rightarrow_\\lambda$ 与完全展开 $(-)^\\star$ 见 [[56-df-lambda-complete-development]]；根收缩所需的同时替换接口见 [[56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"72b587eaf1edf078","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 Proposition 10.2.4 及证明（印刷 p556，OCR 页块577），本次已读。按同时归约的推导归纳；根 β 分支使用内部 [[56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution]]，其陈述补齐本文件原先仅以原书编号10.2.2引用的接口，应用分支区分左项原本是否为抽象。该陈述立即让同源两条同时归约在 M* 汇合。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)","display":false},{"tex":"M,N\\in\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"(-)^\\star","display":false},{"tex":"M\\Rightarrow_\\lambda N\\Longrightarrow N\\Rightarrow_\\lambda M^\\star.","display":true}],"bytes":1297,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-296","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-lambda-triangle.md]]"},{"id":"f84615aea647a602","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["e75dc86b680683eb","72b587eaf1edf078"]}